<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Jesus only is our Savior,</l><l>All our guilt He bore away,</l><l>He, our righteousness forever,</l><l>All our strength from day to day.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Jesus is our Sanctifier,</l><l>Saving us from self and sin,</l><l>And with all His Spirit’s fulness,</l><l>Filling all our hearts within.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Jesus only is our Healer,</l><l>All our sicknesses He bare,</l><l>And His risen life and fulness,</l><l>All His members still may share.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Jesus only is our Power,</l><l>He the gift of Pentecost;</l><l>Jesus, breathe Thy pow’r upon us,</l><l>Fill us with the Holy Ghost.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>And for Jesus we are waiting,</l><l>List’ning for the Advent Call;</l><l>But ’twill still be Jesus only,</l><l>Jesus ever, all in all.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
